  "question": {
    "text": "The energy of activation for a reaction is <math><mn>100</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mtext>kJ&nbsp;mo</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> . Presence of a catalyst lowers the activation energy by 75%. What will be effect on rate of reaction at <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> , other things being equal?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "4w13k",
      "text": "increases by a factor of<br><math><mn>2.34</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Wjp2H",
      "text": "increases by a factor of<br><math> <mrow>  <mn>2.34</mn><mo>&#x00D7;</mo><msup>   <mrow>    <mn>10</mn></mrow>   <mrow>    <mn>10</mn></mrow>  </msup>  </mrow></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VOKUJ",
      "text": "increases by a factor of<math> <mrow>  <msup>   <mrow>    <mn>10</mn></mrow>   <mrow>    <mn>15</mn></mrow>  </msup>  </mrow></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "iwGpn",
      "text": "no effect",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The Arrhenius equation is<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>A</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mtext>RT</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br />In absence of catalyst, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>A</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mtext>RT</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br />In presence of catalyst, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>A</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mtext>RT</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br />So <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>75</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mtext>RT</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math> or 2.303 <math><mtext>lo</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mtext>RT</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br />or <math><mn>2.303</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mtext>log</mtext><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8.314</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>293</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />or <math><mtext>log</mtext><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8.314</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>293</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2.303</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />or <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.34</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />As the things being equal in presence or absence of a catalyst,<br /><math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mtext>k</mtext>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  <mo>=</mo></mrow></math> rate in presence of catalyst<br /><math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mtext>k</mtext>   <mtext>1</mtext>  </msub>  <mtext>=</mtext></mrow></math> rate in absence of catalyst<br />i.e., <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.34</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
